"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98379.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-10T15:07:22Z"},"body":"Fixes #97853\r\n\r\nThread name is generated by the debugger in the running project. So it's affected by the project's pseudo-localization settings.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/44fa552343722bb048e2d7c6d3661174a95a8a3c/core/debugger/remote_debugger.cpp#L422\r\n\r\nSince the ID of main thread is fixed, we can simply send the ID instead of the name, then generate and translate the \"Main Thread\" text in the editor.\r\n\r\nThis changes the fourth field of the `debug_enter` message from a string to the thread ID.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98379/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98379/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}